    {
      "id": "5129e148-b352-45c0-b35f-e7f2389534b8",
      "title": "Compare as duas formas e observe o pedaço final que muda.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 4,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "9c9118b3-5950-4091-a000-7883e2a95224",
          "textContent": "<p>Em <strong>estudiaba</strong>, o final <strong>-aba</strong> aparece com verbos regulares terminados em <strong>-ar</strong>.</p><p>Em <strong>entendía</strong>, o final <strong>-ía</strong> aparece com verbos regulares terminados em <strong>-er</strong> ou <strong>-ir</strong>.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
